{
  "info" : {
    "name" : "audit-api Postman Collection",
    "description" : "Immutable event logging service for security, compliance, and forensics.\nCaptures every critical action performed across all microservices (Enhancement, \nAssessment, Auth, Secrets, etc.) in a tamper-proof, searchable format.\nSupports SOC2 and ISO27001 audit requirements.\n\n\nOpenAPI version: 1.0.0",
